      "text": "Repository development practice: contributors fork, create a feature branch, test locally with --plugin-dir, add a CHANGELOG [Unreleased] entry for user-visible changes, and submit a pull request; the repo's own test suite runs via ./tests/run-tests.sh with no dependencies beyond bash/awk/sed/sort/grep."
